# Frontend

## Staff `(app)/`

- `page.tsx` thin → `PageClient.tsx` — [ADR-003](../../docs/adr/ADR-003-pageclient-pattern.md), Skill [create-page.md](../../skills/create-page.md).
- `PageHeader`(title만) + `PageLoader` / `EmptyState` / `ErrorBanner`.
- 탭: `useSearchParams` + `?tab=` + `<Suspense>`.
- Dashboard 위젯: `components/dashboard/DashboardPrimitives.tsx`.
- 차트: recharts, 심플 운영형 — 장식용 과다 색 금지.

## Hooks

- Skill [create-hook.md](../../skills/create-hook.md).
- `useAuth()` → `academy_id` · `useStaffScope()` · `dataVersion` / `bumpDataVersion()`.
- React Query **금지** — [ADR-002](../../docs/adr/ADR-002-no-react-query.md).

## Shell별

- Marketing: `lib/marketing/ui.ts` — AppShell/Sidebar import 금지.
- Portal: `components/portal/*`, `ParentShell`.
- Auth: `components/auth/AuthShell`.

